# Chicken Pad See Ew

Based on [https://www.cookwell.com/recipe/chicken-pad-see-ew](https://www.cookwell.com/recipe/chicken-pad-see-ew) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251206114547/https://www.cookwell.com/recipe/chicken-pad-see-ew))

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Pad See Ew Sauce

- [ ] 25 g [Dark soy sauce]{ ing="dark-soy-sauce" } (1 part)
- [ ] 25 g [Soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } (1 part)
- [ ] 25 g [Oyster sauce]{ ing="oyster-sauce" } (1 part)
- [ ] 25 g [Sugar]{ ing="sugar" } (1 part)
- [ ] 10 g [Fish sauce]{ ing="fish-sauce" } (1/2 part)

### Base Stir Fry Ingredients

- [ ] 150 g [Wide rice noodles]{ ing="wide-rice-noodles" }
- [ ] [Cooking oil]{ ing="cooking-oil" }, for stir frying
- [ ] 2 [Eggs]{ ing="egg" }, beaten
- [ ] 3-4 cloves [Garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, thinly sliced
- [ ] [White pepper]{ ing="white-pepper" }, to taste
- [ ] 1 [Chicken breast]{ ing="chicken-breast" }, thinly sliced (225 g)
- [ ] 1 bunch [Broccolini]{ ing="broccolini" }, roughly chopped (200 g)

## Recipe

1. Prep the [noodles]{ ing="wide-rice-noodles" } and [sauce]{ ing="dark-soy-sauce" } by soaking noodles per package directions. Mix all [sauce]{ ing="fish-sauce" } ingredients until combined; can be prepared ahead.
1. Stir fry [eggs]{ ing="egg" } and vegetables by heating wok over high heat with [oil]{ ing="cooking-oil" }. Swirl in beaten egg until fluffy; remove to bowl. Add oil, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, and [pepper]{ ing="white-pepper" }; bloom 30-45 seconds. Stir fry [broccolini]{ ing="broccolini" } 1-2 minutes with [sauce]{ ing="dark-soy-sauce" } drizzle; set aside with eggs.
1. Brown the chicken by adding [oil]{ ing="cooking-oil" } and chicken slices; brown 2 minutes each side. Season with [sauce]{ ing="dark-soy-sauce" } drizzle for color.
1. Bring it all together by returning [broccolini]{ ing="broccolini" } and [eggs]{ ing="egg" } to wok with drained [noodles]{ ing="wide-rice-noodles" }. Add [sauce]{ ing="dark-soy-sauce" } to coat. Stir fry 5-7 minutes until noodles soften and absorb [sauce]{ ing="fish-sauce" }. Adjust texture with extra [sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } or water if needed. Serve with [white pepper]{ ing="white-pepper" }.

## Notes

- Serves 2-3 in 45 minutes
- Soaking prevents noodles from stickiness during cooking
- Cook in stages to achieve proper browning without crowding the pan
- Taste and adjust seasonings before serving
